Package: kite-chromebook
Version: 1.0.2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KiteOS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: python3, keyd, alsa-ucm-conf, alsa-utils, firmware-sof-signed, diffutils
Description: KiteOS hardware support for Intel Chromebooks running MrChromebox UEFI
 Tuned for the HP Chromebook 11 G8 EE (board VORTICON, Gemini Lake / octopus),
 but detects the hardware at boot and does nothing on non-Chromebooks:
  * ChromeOS-style keyboard via keyd (Search key opens the launcher,
    Search+top row = F1-F10, Search+Backspace = Delete, Search+arrows = Home/End/PgUp/PgDn)
  * Chromebook audio UCM profiles (alsa-ucm-conf-cros) and SOF driver selection
  * WirePlumber and libinput tweaks
  * the lid keeps working after hibernation (EC event masks restored on resume)
